WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 6.9 · MEAL: Monitoring, Evaluation, Accountability & Learning
Accountability: participation, feedback and complaints

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Let the people you serve shape the work and raise concerns, built in before habits set.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Offer feedback channels that suit different people.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Include a trusted route outside the founding team.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Close the loop: say what changed, or why not.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You design your feedback and complaints mechanism.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
